# text = ELLIOT OF KELLYNCH HALL . " Walter Elliot , born March 1 , 1760 , married , July 15 , 1784 , Elizabeth , daughter of James Stevenson , Esq . of South Park , in the county of Gloucester , by which lady ( who died 1800 ) he has issue Elizabeth , born June 1 , 1785 ; Anne , born August 9 , 1787 ; a still-born son , November 5 , 1789 ; Mary , born November 20 , 1791 Married , December 16 , 1810 , Charles , son and heir of Charles Musgrove , Esq . of Uppercross , in the county of Somerset Principal seat , Kellynch Hall , in the county of Somerset Heir presumptive , William Walter Elliot , Esq ., great grandson of the second Sir Walter For they must have been seen together once at Tattersall's , and twice in the lobby of the House of Commons Can we retrench ?
